-factory/milestones/2/labels","id":18779623,"node_id":"MI_kwDOVSGryM4BHo3n","number":2,"title":"Week 2: Pipeline Validation & Content Launch","description":"Validate all pipelines, launch first content batch, schedule in Buffer","creator":{"login":"somilsharma2000","id":222891661,"node_id":"U_kgDODUkOjQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222891661?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/somilsharma2000","html_url":"https://github.com/somilsharma2000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somilsharma2000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somilsharma2000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somilsharma2000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somilsharma2000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somilsharma2000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somilsharma2000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somilsharma2000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somilsharma2000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somilsharma2000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":7,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-10-21T12:46:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:02:27Z","due_on":"2026-11-04T00:00:00Z","closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-21T13:02:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:02:07Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Role: Automation Engineer\n**Objective**: Create Notion databases and dashboards per `analytics/dashboard.md` and `crm/README.md`.\n\n## Databases to Create (Notion)\n1. **Daily Metrics** - Platform, impressions, reach, engagement, revenue\n2. **Weekly Rollups** - Auto-calculated from daily\n3. **Monthly Business Review** - Revenue by stream, follower growth, pipeline\n4. **Contacts/CRM** - Brands, creators, agencies, fans\n5. **Deals Pipeline** - Discovery → Proposal → Negotiation → Contract → Delivery → Paid\n6. **Content Pipeline** - Idea → Scripted → Assets Ready → Produced → Captioned → Scheduled → Posted → Analyzed\n7. **Fanvue Subscribers** - Tier, LTV, PPV purchases, engagement score\n8. **Affiliate Tracking** - Clicks, conversions, revenue per program\n\n## Make.com Scenarios\n1. **Daily Metrics Sync** - APIs → Notion Daily Metrics\n2. **Deal Stage Change** → Notion update + Slack notification\n3. **Content Scheduled** → Buffer import + Calendar event\n4. **Fanvue Renewal/Churn** → Tag for retention DM\n5. **Invoice Overdue** → Auto-reminder email\n6. **Weekly Review** → Compile metrics → Notion page + Slack summary\n\n## Visualization Charts (Notion/Grafana)\n1. Follower Growth Waterfall (stacked area by platform)\n2. Revenue Stacked Bar (by stream, target line $10K MRR)\n3. Engagement Heatmap (day × hour)\n4. Content Performance Scatter (impressions × engagement, size=revenue)\n5. Funnel: Social → Fanvue (impressions → profile visits → link clicks → subscribe)\n6. Brand Deal Pipeline (count, value, velocity by stage)\n7. Content Pillar Balance (pie chart + revenue per pillar)\n7. ROI by Platform (revenue/hour invested)\n\n## Deliverables\n- [ ] All 8 Notion databases created with correct properties\n- [ ] 6 Make.com scenarios deployed\n- [ ] Dashboard page with 8 charts\n- [ ] Weekly review template (`analytics/monthly_reviews/YYYY-MM_strategy.md`)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/somilsharma2000/zara-velasquez-factory/issues/16/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/somilsharma2000/zara-velasquez-factory/issues/16/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}